:: StoryTitle
RUT Demo

:: StoryData
{
  "ifid": "D674C58C-DEFA-4F70-B7A2-27742230C0FC",
  "format": "SugarCube",
  "format-version": "2.36.1",
  "start": "Start"
}

:: StoryInit
<<set $gold to 3>>
<<set $He to "she">>

:: Start
Welcome to the village, traveller! You have <<print $gold>> coins in your pocket.
An old merchant waves at you. $He smiles and points at the road.

[[Walk into the forest|Forest]]
[[Visit the market|Market]]

:: Forest
The forest is dark and quiet. Somewhere far away an owl is hooting.
<<link "Pick up a shiny coin">><<set $gold += 1>><<goto "Start">><</link>>

:: Market
<<if $gold gte 5>>You buy a warm loaf of bread.<<else>>You cannot afford anything here yet.<</if>>
<<button "Go back">><<goto "Start">><</button>>
